sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant E as NexusSaga
    participant K as Kafka
    participant S as Participant
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Op as Operator
    E->>K: COMPENSATE step i (attempt 1)
    S-->>E: FAILURE (or timeout)
    E->>K: COMPENSATE step i (attempt 2..maxRetries+1)
    S-->>E: FAILURE
    E->>DB: TX: COMPENSATION_FAILED_DLQ + saga_dlq row + audit SAGA_DEAD_LETTERED
    Op->>E: GET /api/v1/dlq
    alt Replay
        Op->>E: POST /dlq/{sagaId}/replay
        E->>DB: TX: reopen COMPENSATING at step i + outbox + audit DLQ_REPLAYED
        E->>K: COMPENSATE step i → reverse traversal continues to step 0
    else Force-complete
        Op->>E: POST /dlq/{sagaId}/force-complete {note}
        E->>DB: TX: FAILED + dlq FORCE_COMPLETED + audit DLQ_FORCE_COMPLETED
    end
